[
  {
    "id": "l001",
    "member_id": "",
    "room": "",
    "text": "今天天氣真好，適合去外面剪羊毛。",
    "is_demo": true
  },
  {
    "id": "l002",
    "member_id": "",
    "room": "",
    "text": "你也是來找人合奏的嗎？",
    "is_demo": true
  },
  {
    "id": "l003",
    "member_id": "",
    "room": "",
    "text": "好久沒上線了，大家都還在呢。",
    "is_demo": true
  },
  {
    "id": "l004",
    "member_id": "",
    "room": "",
    "text": "城堡好大，我剛剛差點迷路。",
    "is_demo": true
  },
  {
    "id": "l005",
    "member_id": "",
    "room": "",
    "text": "肚子有點餓，等等去酒館吃點東西。",
    "is_demo": true
  },
  {
    "id": "l006",
    "member_id": "",
    "room": "",
    "text": "客房的床好軟，一躺下就不想起來了。",
    "is_demo": true
  },
  {
    "id": "l007",
    "member_id": "",
    "room": "",
    "text": "嗨！歡迎來玩～",
    "is_demo": true
  },
  {
    "id": "l008",
    "member_id": "",
    "room": "",
    "text": "昨天的團練好累，但很開心。",
    "is_demo": true
  },
  {
    "id": "l009",
    "member_id": "",
    "room": "",
    "text": "你看起來有點眼熟耶。",
    "is_demo": true
  },
  {
    "id": "l010",
    "member_id": "",
    "room": "",
    "text": "我在等朋友上線。",
    "is_demo": true
  },
  {
    "id": "l011",
    "member_id": "",
    "room": "",
    "text": "有空一起去打副本嗎？",
    "is_demo": true
  },
  {
    "id": "l012",
    "member_id": "",
    "room": "",
    "text": "這套衣服是我新換的，好看嗎？",
    "is_demo": true
  },
  {
    "id": "l013",
    "member_id": "",
    "room": "",
    "text": "今天也要好好練琴。",
    "is_demo": true
  },
  {
    "id": "l014",
    "member_id": "",
    "room": "",
    "text": "咦，你是新來的嗎？",
    "is_demo": true
  },
  {
    "id": "l015",
    "member_id": "",
    "room": "",
    "text": "要不要坐下來聊聊天？",
    "is_demo": true
  },
  {
    "id": "l016",
    "member_id": "",
    "room": "hall",
    "text": "公告板上又貼了新東西。",
    "is_demo": true
  },
  {
    "id": "l017",
    "member_id": "",
    "room": "hall",
    "text": "會長今天好像有事要宣布。",
    "is_demo": true
  },
  {
    "id": "l018",
    "member_id": "",
    "room": "hall",
    "text": "大廳的紅地毯是不是又換新的了？",
    "is_demo": true
  },
  {
    "id": "l019",
    "member_id": "",
    "room": "hall",
    "text": "這張討論桌每次都坐滿人。",
    "is_demo": true
  },
  {
    "id": "l020",
    "member_id": "",
    "room": "music",
    "text": "下一首要練什麼曲子呢？",
