  },
  {
    "id": "l021",
    "member_id": "",
    "room": "music",
    "text": "我的小提琴好像走音了。",
    "is_demo": true
  },
  {
    "id": "l022",
    "member_id": "",
    "room": "music",
    "text": "安靜，演奏要開始了。",
    "is_demo": true
  },
  {
    "id": "l023",
    "member_id": "",
    "room": "music",
    "text": "指揮的手勢好帥。",
    "is_demo": true
  },
  {
    "id": "l024",
    "member_id": "",
    "room": "music",
    "text": "坐在這裡聽大家練習最舒服了。",
