  },
  {
    "id": "l507",
    "member_id": "",
    "room": "training",
    "text": "練完記得把木劍放回架子上喔。",
    "is_demo": true
  },
  {
    "id": "l508",
    "member_id": "",
    "room": "forge",
    "text": "火候差一點，這把劍就打不好了。",
    "is_demo": true
  },
  {
    "id": "l509",
    "member_id": "",
    "room": "forge",
    "text": "鏗鏗鏗……耳朵都嗡嗡響了。",
    "is_demo": true
  },
  {
    "id": "l510",
    "member_id": "",
    "room": "forge",
    "text": "要修裝備的話放在工作台上就好。",
    "is_demo": true
  },
  {
    "id": "l601",
    "member_id": "",
    "room": "courtyard",
    "text": "羊毛剪下來軟綿綿的，好想拿來當枕頭。",
    "is_demo": true
  },
  {
    "id": "l602",
    "member_id": "",
    "room": "courtyard",
    "text": "噴泉旁邊好涼，坐著就不想動了。",
    "is_demo": true
  },
  {
    "id": "l603",
    "member_id": "",
    "room": "courtyard",
    "text": "今天輪到我澆花，花圃的花都開了。",
    "is_demo": true
  },
  {
    "id": "l604",
    "member_id": "",
    "room": "courtyard",
    "text": "紡車踩久了腳好痠，換你來試試？",
